			(property "Description" "The 7164 5V CMOS SRAM is organized as 8K x 8. The 7164 offers a reduced power standby mode.  The low-power (L) version also offers a battery backup data retention capability at power supply levels as low as 2V. All inputs and outputs of the IDT7164 are TTL-compatible and operation is from a single 5V supply, simplifying system designs. Fully static asynchronous circuitry is used, requiring no clocks or refreshing for operation. Military grade product is available."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
